         (build_output_2.log ... build_output_46_pcapeventbridge_final.log, build_diag.log)
         into wildcard removes to avoid the list growing unbounded on every build/debug run.
         Prefer not creating new build_output_*.log files inside the project directory at all;
         if a scratch log is needed, write it outside the project tree (e.g., a temp folder). -->
    <None Remove="build_output_*.log" />
